00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:54.200
new engineers onboarding today, where's the DevOps information?

516
00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:56.760
How do I get access to the Kubernetes cluster? Right.

517
00:22:56.760 --> 00:22:59.000
It's not really that's that is sometimes the question.

518
00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:00.680
And when I see that I say no, no, no, no, no.

519
00:23:00.680 --> 00:23:03.000
Go ask do we have a skill that explains this

520
00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:06.360
so I can install it in my agent that needs to become the default reaction.

521
00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:07.680
Right. And that's a cultural shift.

522
00:23:07.680 --> 00:23:08.120
You have to

523
00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:12.520
actually intentionally kind of engineer and kind of distill down to your team.

