00:23:46.560 --> 00:23:47.040
Whatever.

539
00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:48.480
Least me, I'm going back Monday.

540
00:23:48.480 --> 00:23:50.880
But you want to just start small.

541
00:23:50.880 --> 00:23:53.880
You don't need to go build some crazy robust platform like we did

542
00:23:53.880 --> 00:23:56.520
that that came from like two years of us beating our head off a wall, right.

543
00:23:56.520 --> 00:23:58.680
So really wanted something more robust.

544
00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:00.480
But you don't have to start there.

545
00:24:00.480 --> 00:24:01.600
Start with one workflow,

546
00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:03.800
one concept, one thing that you find yourself

547
00:24:03.800 --> 00:24:04.480
explaining over

548
00:24:04.480 --> 00:24:07.680
and over to different audiences and just turn that into a skill

